1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:03,050
(Leonard:)I'm missing something.

2
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:07,050
(Leonard:)Did you say something to Penny
about Alex?

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:13,240
Yes, and a fat lot of good it did me.
All she did was get mad at you.

4
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,570
(Leonard:)Why would you do that?

5
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,400
(Sheldon:)I needed advice about a woman.

6
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,160
(Sheldon:)I would have asked you, but if the
last few years have proven anything...

7
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,890
(Sheldon:)...it's that you can't tell a uterus
from a unicycle.

8
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:30,290
(Leonard:)At least I know not to blab to a girl
about somebody flirting with her boyfriend.

9
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,720
(Sheldon:)Good to know.
A few more helpful hints like that...

10
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:36,410
(Sheldon:)...you may find yourself
on the Council of Ladies.

11
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,560
Hello?

12
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,570
I see. What time?

13
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:44,730
(Sheldon:)Very well, then.

14
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:49,760
(Sheldon:)Huh. That was the Human Resources
Department at the university.

15
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:54,020
(Sheldon:)Apparently my assistant, Alex,
has filed a complaint accusing me of...

